{"about_the_game":"<strong>&quot;AIM&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Climbing Game&quot;</strong><br><br><strong>Aim Climb&quot; is a platform game in which you use your &quot;Aiming skill&quot; to climb to the top and reach the summit.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim accurately at the scattered &quot;targets&quot; and click to make your character make a big jump.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/84ef4656c625f87cc00ef79b01b47acc.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/84ef4656c625f87cc00ef79b01b47acc.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/84ef4656c625f87cc00ef79b01b47acc.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >However, if left unattended, the character will fall down. </h2>Thus, it means <u>you need to click on the next target during the dwell time.</u><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/982c43ff7bf8f480a8aaca1718392129.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/982c43ff7bf8f480a8aaca1718392129.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/982c43ff7bf8f480a8aaca1718392129.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br><strong>&quot;Continuous jumps feel great!!!!!&quot;</strong><br><br>The character jumps toward the clicked location. <u>In order to climb up efficiently, the horizontal speed must be kept as low as possible.</u> In other words, <u>you must instantly consider the target to aim at and the timing of that click, depending on the character's position and the direction it is going.</u><br>\u2193Bad example<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/538ce67e591868a4cc9553495dc598ae.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/538ce67e591868a4cc9553495dc598ae.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/538ce67e591868a4cc9553495dc598ae.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.<br>What do you think? The operation is simple, but it looks quite deep, doesn't it?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are various types of &quot;targets&quot; to keep players occupied.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/9de194160ac0e9ba10455a73d71fc000.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/9de194160ac0e9ba10455a73d71fc000.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/9de194160ac0e9ba10455a73d71fc000.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/183b692a48894b56f0a015c68a4a5e32.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/183b692a48894b56f0a015c68a4a5e32.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/183b692a48894b56f0a015c68a4a5e32.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/1da8928ad01d65c8172f8a70e3ba969f.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=192 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/1da8928ad01d65c8172f8a70e3ba969f.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/1da8928ad01d65c8172f8a70e3ba969f.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The higher you climb, the more difficult the &quot;targets&quot; become. tracking and holding aim, flicking aim,,<u>The thrill increases.</u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you happen to miss your aim, use the &quot;ascending skill&quot;. </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/627aa89b9d6622790dc1df3ade5ccb1c.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=192 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/627aa89b9d6622790dc1df3ade5ccb1c.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/627aa89b9d6622790dc1df3ade5ccb1c.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/09becad5e56803a2a85244167eb3443a.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=192 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/09becad5e56803a2a85244167eb3443a.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/09becad5e56803a2a85244167eb3443a.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>When the skill is used, the character <u>jumps slightly to buy time to adjust the aim.</u><br>This skill can also be <u>used effectively to increase the speed of ascent when you click on targets.</u> <strong>It is up to the player's discretion whether you can use it well or not.</strong><br><br><strong>\u25a0Three levels of difficulty</strong><br>There is a difficulty level for beginners who are not accustomed to mouse operation, a difficulty level for gamers who are accustomed to mouse operation, and a difficulty level for so-called masochistic gamers.<br>The highest difficulty level cannot be cleared with half-hearted determination.<br><br><strong>Cute dot pictures</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/f7aa48ca4eb3f46047ba491ef4e66eb0.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/f7aa48ca4eb3f46047ba491ef4e66eb0.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/f7aa48ca4eb3f46047ba491ef4e66eb0.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>. <br><br><strong>\u25a0The scenery changes as you move up.</strong><br>Caves, forests, old cities, waterfalls, etc.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clearing the game involves a great deal of hard work. </h2><strong>However, let us guarantee an &quot;overwhelming sense of accomplishment&quot; for that.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/d1437266e65b103c1e0d6f9f49d7d31c.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/d1437266e65b103c1e0d6f9f49d7d31c.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/d1437266e65b103c1e0d6f9f49d7d31c.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>. <br><br><br><br>-Aim Climb-<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/b742a5c6d0527468e6df991580a902a8.avif?t=1748990018\" width=442 height=248 /></span><br><i>In a dark, dark cave, there is a cat girl who dreams of the outside world.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Aiming skill could change her fate.</h2>Your dominant hand, holding the PC mouse, becomes a &quot;magic gun&quot; that descends into her world to support her dreams.<br><br>You need to click on the magic stones scattered around to climb.<br>Clicking, climbing, clicking, climbing, clicking, climbing,,,,,,,,<br><br>And if you fail to aim, she falls.<br><br>No matter how many times she falls, she never gives up. Her eyes are always lit with glimmer of hope.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/13f802e7e7c145ca11caf0d41355ddba.poster.avif?t=1748990018\" width=256 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/13f802e7e7c145ca11caf0d41355ddba.webm?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/13f802e7e7c145ca11caf0d41355ddba.mp4?t=1748990018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Do you really see that? <br><br><strong>Can you take her to the outside world? And when you reach the top, what will the view be like?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/extras/9799734ab78450ddec807da7fe2af4fe.avif?t=1748990018\" width=538 height=174 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"PANCAKE MAKER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1909770/586c6d83de15397ef139931b69732298fd9f7d44.jpg"},{"name":"TARGET HITTING MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1909770/a44c463dc44223db65177599e1e971ece83a635d.jpg"},{"name":"SNIPE MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1909770/3d0ec70c12a7937e19202813c1017cf61aaba735.jpg"},{"name":"TRUE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1909770/f308fcaec359864b49cd3586b472b2992056d46f.jpg"},{"name":"NEXT TRUE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1909770/5513fd46e94b4427d7936916efe12bb8ef99b0cd.jpg"},{"name":"ANNYA CONTROL MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1909770/f5b47eeca76c98381e8cf5f5d07791f1405207dd.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1909770?t=1748990018","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1909770?t=1748990018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748990018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748990018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family S